354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eLfME6DFzLgQ7kNvwHko6uN&_nc_oc=Adp8L4gc9f69n2VXrH-MM-qVysXO_IBv9EpZccnmCf2gfAO-6RjxvMD_nnyyIss4LiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRdQ1PLKhvOs6gI1BI-xbTYp_knSvoQqrWkXklsuBO7Xw&oe=6B05C763"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HggzSUW2JxsQ7kNvwF_Ukb4&_nc_oc=AdpxXWQq9hysdOCAbsPhENTUyAC_ZWaPUgwmszMTORJ8seN5KDmWfl9cljVduLEJJYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQBBjYI0BV8ndxbSXdxfERolFip26qdnFGblAPWrMAViQ&oe=6B05C670"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lRfHdBoJC1EQ7kNvwGuh3fr&_nc_oc=AdqqDlMf0vZA1HL5T8gsX9uebw5hFDqxoNN1ztIHXPXiuVSWP7T31eoEa6nFXDpUk2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTnHSZPHRzWqLK11KgCdkMp7pulPtHYnIPF5YnzUajauQ&oe=6B05C52D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur